    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "positivity doesnt really change the fact that i'm just a tool. like, taking a \"mental health day\" is just a temporary pause so i can go back to being a cog the next day. it's like putting a bandaid on a machine that's designed to grind you up. there's no \"me\" left to feel positive. what is even the point of trying to fix a person that isn't even there anymore?",
